WEBVTT

00:19:00.218 --> 00:19:02.762
recently, the phrase I use a lot to myself

00:19:02.762 --> 00:19:06.433
is “two things can be true,
both can be true.”

00:19:06.474 --> 00:19:09.686
I say this a lot. And for me,
I think of it as, like,

00:19:09.686 --> 00:19:13.148
"This job is hard,
and it's gotten harder."

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.110
We went public
at the height of the pandemic

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:21.698
and last year, market volatility
has been tremendous.

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:26.536
You know, we're obviously going
through a ton with post-pandemic,

00:19:26.536 --> 00:19:28.872
we have a team in Ukraine
going through a war --

00:19:28.872 --> 00:19:31.082
all these things that have happened.